  "description": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We are an online destination that offers a carefully curated collection of apparel, accessories, and wall art, all inspired by the breathtaking wonders of the great outdoors. Our mission is to bring the essence of nature into your everyday life and encourage you to embark on your own adventures.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">But we are more than just a shop. For every order placed, a tree is planted, contributing to reforestation efforts and preserving the natural beauty we adore. Additionally, all our orders come with carbon neutral shipping, as we strive to minimize our environmental impact, funding innovations on direct air capture, bio oil and mineralization.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We hope our products and content inspire you to embrace the wonders of nature, step outside your comfort zone, and create unforgettable memories in the great outdoors.</span></p>",
